# AI pilot from a new game: on by --pilot-at, ~20 min of play, then hand-back by F8 and by a world click
waitplay
wait 1170
shot Y:\shots\demo\pilot_new_20min
log TEST: F8 turns the pilot off
key F8
wait 4
log TEST: F8 turns it on again
key F8
wait 10
shot Y:\shots\demo\pilot_new_badge
log TEST: a movement click in the world takes over
click 700,380
wait 5
shot Y:\shots\demo\pilot_new_after
quit
